# P0.15 — everything fetched or generated locally stays OUT of the tree, exactly as P0.13 did.
#
#  · .venv/  — the isolated Python env (p99turn + onnxruntime + huggingface_hub), created from
#              requirements.txt; NEVER wired into package.json / server/package.json / tsconfig /
#              vite / scripts/test.sh (see RESULT.json.evidence.noTrainingWeights.venvPackages).
#  · data/   — the eot-bench parquet (~162 MB, CC-BY-4.0) and its extracted per-turn WAVs, the 16
#              LibriSpeech clips, the HF cache, the generated span manifests and score files. All of
#              it is re-fetchable byte-for-byte by `fetch-and-verify.mjs --all` at the pinned
#              revisions; the committed records carry the MEASURED sha256 for each file instead of the
#              bytes (AC4's second branch), and RESULT.json.reproduction holds the per-file hashes from
#              the run that produced these records.
#  · _cache/ — Smart Turn score tables and scratch. Never a committed artifact: RESULT.json records
#              the cell count and the re-run audit that proves the table holds model output.
.venv/
data/
_cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
